[15.776, "o", "\u001b[38;5;81m›\u001b[0m AI model — how will soc-ai reach one?\r\n"]
[16.176, "o", "      1) Local / self-hosted endpoint you run (LiteLLM gateway, vLLM, Ollama) — nothing leaves your network\r\n"]
[16.376, "o", "      2) Cloud API key (OpenRouter or another OpenAI-compatible provider) — no local infra, redacted egress\r\n"]
[16.676, "o", "    Route [1]: "]
