[36.306, "o", "    Password: \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;221mKx7mR9pQ2wL4nF\u001b[0m    ← save this now; change it after first login\r\n"]
[36.606, "o", "\r\n"]
[36.756, "o", "    Logs:   docker compose logs -f soc-ai      Stop: docker compose down      Update: git pull && docker compose up -d --build\r\n"]
[37.006, "o", "\r\n"]
[37.156, "o", "    \u001b[1mRecommended next steps:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[37.356, "o", "      • Auto-triage is ON — a sweep runs every 5 min (≤25 alerts, high-severity+).\r\n"]
[37.536, "o", "        Turn it off in Config → Triage automation, or set AUTO_TRIAGE_SCHEDULE_ENABLED=false in .env.\r\n"]
[37.736, "o", "      • Back up before every upgrade:  docker compose exec soc-ai python -m soc_ai backup --out /var/lib/soc-ai/data/backup.tar.gz\r\n"]
